Brief update on the progress of the EMNLP 2026 AI Reviewing Experiment and a timeline for releasing the AI reviews to opted-in authors.

On May 10, it was announced that 7,921 submissions opted into the experiment. Efforts have been focused on designing the experiment, creating author feedback surveys, and pilot testing the AI reviewing systems. The AI reviews are planned to be posted to the OpenReview page of opted-in submissions around July 20.

